IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SIMPLE-VARIABLES.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 EMP-1.
    02  EMP-NAME.
        03 NAME-FIRST PIC X(10) VALUE "MARTY".
        03 NAME-LAST  PIC X(10) VALUE "HEYMAN".
        03 PET-NAME   PIC X(10) VALUE "JORDON".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000-Main.
    DISPLAY NAME-FIRST IN EMP-NAME IN EMP-1.
    DISPLAY NAME-LAST  IN EMP-NAME IN EMP-1.
    DISPLAY PET-NAME   IN EMP-NAME IN EMP-1.
    STOP RUN.
END PROGRAM SIMPLE-VARIABLES.

